      "taskType": "representationTranslation",
      "prompt": "The table is claimed to show an inverse variation between x and y. Use all completed rows to verify the constant product, formulate y as an inverse-variation equation, and use the equation to complete the missing y-value.",
      "stimulus": {
        "kind": "table",
