      "prompt": "A student is told that y varies inversely with x and that y={{y1}} when x={{x1}}. The student writes k=y/x={{wrongK}} and then y={{wrongK}}x. Diagnose the variation error, determine the correct constant, formulate the corrected inverse-variation equation, and use it to find y when x={{x2}}.",
      "stimulus": {
